 ### Data Structures
-*   **Triangulation:** A Delaunay triangulation of the current set of probes (vertices) [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Voronoi Diagram:** The dual of the triangulation, used to identify infinite edges and probe cells [S1, unofficial].
